[
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──よし、いくぞ？　ええと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "003",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『ラジオの前のみなさん、お待たせしました！\r\n今週のゲストはこの方──八宮めぐるさん！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "リスナーのみなさん、こんにちは！\r\nイルミネーションスターズの八宮めぐるです！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『いらっしゃーい！\r\n今日は色々聞いちゃおうと思うけど、準備はいいかな？』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もちろんです！\r\nよろしくお願いします！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『はい！　よろしくねー！\r\nじゃあまずは基本プロフィールから──』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ふふっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、いつもより元気だねっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うっ……！\r\n似合ってないのはわかるけど、我慢してくれよ……？！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "パーソナリティーさん、陽気な感じだから──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "少しでも慣れておけるように、ってことだよね？\r\nえへへ、わかってるよ！　ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……でも、それはそれとして\r\n珍しいなっていうのはやっぱり思っちゃうかも？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……！　おいおい\r\nあんまりからかわないでくれって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "はーい、ごめんなさいっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、じゃあ続きから\r\n──『八宮さんはアメリカ出身の高校１年生』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『アイドルになったきっかけは、\r\n友達が履歴書を送ったから』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『──出た！　友達が勝手に応募ってやつ！\r\nこういうのってホントにあるんだ！？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "はいっ、ホントにあるんです！\r\nわたしがそうなので",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『へぇー……！　お友達、なんで八宮さんに\r\nアイドルになってほしかったんだろう？』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "んー……あれ……？\r\n……そういえば、聞いたことない……？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ごめんなさい！\r\n理由、わからなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『そ、そうなんだ……！？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……プロデューサー。今の質問って、\r\n本番までに答え聞いておいた方がいいかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　うーん……\r\nちなみにめぐるは、どうして理由を聞かなかったんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──えっと……書類が通ったって話を聞いた時に、\r\n『めぐるちゃんなら受かると思った！』って教えてもらって",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それなら頑張りたい！　って思ったし、せっかくチャンスを\r\nもらったんだったら、挑戦してみたいと思ったし──",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だから、楽しそう！　って感じで、あんまり考えずに\r\n事務所に来ちゃったから、かな……？　えへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだなぁ\r\n俺としては、答えは聞いておかなくても大丈夫だと思う",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その代わり、理由を知らないこととセットで、\r\n今の話までするようにしてほしいかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……今の話、大事？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。何があったかってことよりも、今何が起きてて、\r\nその今の自分がどういう未来を選べるのか──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるはそういうことを重視するんだなって、\r\n伝わってくる話だったから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そ、そうなんだ……！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ちゃんとした答えじゃないのに、\r\nオッケーなこともあるんだね……！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誕生日とか血液型とか、答え自体を知りたい質問もあれば、\r\n答え以上に、めぐるの考えてることが知りたい質問もある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、今みたいに『それは知らない』って\r\n思う質問があっても",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一回落ち着いて、めぐるが思うことを添えてみるといい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっかぁ……！　──うん！　ありがとう！\r\nえへへ、攻略法その１だね！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "パーソナリティーさん、次の質問をお願いします！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『じゃあ、続けていくよー！』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "『今はまっている\r\nことは？』",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "『休日の過ごし方は？』",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "『アイドルって大変？』",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020200,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それは──『アイドル』です！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『模範解答だね！？\r\n……事務所に言わされてない？』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えーっ！？　そんなことないです！\r\n本当に最近はまってるんですよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっと、より一層楽しめるようになった──\r\nって言い方をした方がいいかなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今までは、お仕事楽しい！　って気持ち\r\nばっかりだったんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今は、もうちょっと先の──\r\nこの楽しいお仕事を通して、どういうことが伝えられるかな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしは何を伝えたいのかなって、\r\nそういうことを考える余裕ができてきたというか──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それがもう楽しい、というか！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "join",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020270,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "イルミネのふたりと\r\n色んなところに出掛けています！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『おっと、これは自慢かー？』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あははっ、ごめんなさい！　そうなんです！\r\nわたしたちすっごく仲がいいんですっていう自慢！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ふたりはいつも隣にいてくれて──それが普通に\r\nなってるなんて、わたしすっごく幸せ者だなって！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『……──じゃあ、そんな仲良しのふたりに向けて\r\nメッセージをもらってもいい？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "はいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『真乃ー！　灯織ー！\r\nいつもありがとう、大好きだよーっ！』",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "join",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020320,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そう思ったことはないですね……？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『つらいって思ったことも？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ないです！\r\n楽しいことばっかり！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020340,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今みたいにお話をさせてもらうのも楽しいし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020350,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お芝居のお仕事とか、バラエティとか、\r\nやったことないことをやらせてもらえるのもすごいことだし",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020350"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020360,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "何より、真乃と灯織と一緒に頑張れることが\r\nすっごく楽しいです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020360"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『八宮さん、熱いね～』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020370,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ、ありがとうございますっ\r\nでも、わたしが熱いのはきっとまわりの人のおかげなんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020370"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020380,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしの気持ちを、受け取ってくれる人がいるから──",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "join",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020380"
  },
  {
    "label": "join",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『八宮さん\r\nアイドルって仕事のこと、ホントに好きなんだねぇ』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020390,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "はい──！　大好きだし、大事だし──\r\nもっともっとやってみたいって思ってます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020390"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020400,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ファンのみんなと、他にも支えてくれるみんなに、\r\nたくさん応援してもらっているので",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300302/1003003020400"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003020410,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "真乃と灯織と一緒に、\r\nたくさん返していきたいなって思ってるんですよ！",
